{
  "format": "OscInt CENSUS corpus v1 (docs/prereg/2026-11-09-CENSUS-spec.md §1, §3, §5)",
  "grammar": "u is a polynomial with rational coefficients, written with integers, a/b, + - * ^ and parentheses, in the variables c1 s1 c2 s2 (cos k1, sin k1, cos k2, sin k2; domain 'torus', T^2 = (-pi, pi]^2) or x y (domain 'box', B = [-1, 1]^2). The phase is G(u) with G in {id, sqrt, arccos, arcsin, 2arcsin_sqrt} on its open interval J (spec §1). NS is not listed: each implementation computes it as {u not in J}.",
